<body data-time="all">
  <header class="site"><div class="wrap bar">
    <a class="brand" href="/">Vault <b>Human</b></a>
    <nav class="navlinks"><a href="#how">How it works</a><a href="/method/">The method</a><a href="#pricing">Pricing</a><a href="#russ">About Russ</a><a class="btn btn-acc" href="#" data-open-form>Start free</a></nav>
  </div></header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero hero-video"><video class="bgvid" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1464822759023-fed622ff2c3b?w=1600&q=60&auto=format&fit=crop"><source src="https://assets.mixkit.co/videos/15919/15919-720.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video><div class="veil"></div>
      <div class="wrap hero-grid"><div class="hero-copy">
        <div class="timeword"><span class="tw past">Past</span><span class="tw present">Present</span><span class="tw future">Future</span></div>
        <h1>A coach. Every day. <em>For $97 a month.</em></h1>
        <p class="lede">Vault Human is daily coaching. Each morning you get one short lesson and one small thing to do. A real person reads what you write back. Over a year, your life gets in order.</p>
        <div class="ctarow"><a class="btn btn-acc" href="#" data-open-form>Start free — 7 days of lessons</a><a class="btn btn-line" href="#pricing">Then $97/mo</a></div>
        <p class="guarantee">Seven free days. Then $97 a month. Cancel any time, no questions.</p>
        <p class="welcome">Vault Human · <b>Listen</b> · the whole picture</p>
      </div></div>
      <div class="proof"><div class="wrap proof-grid"><div><b>1</b><span>Key a day</span></div><div><b>11</b><span>Chambers</span></div><div><b>9</b><span>Gates</span></div><div><b>1</b><span>Real coach, not a bot</span></div></div></div>
    </section>

    <section class="sec" id="why"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">Why most self-help fails</p><h2>You don't need more books.<br>You need a plan and a person.</h2></div>
      <div class="quiz"><h3>Thirty seconds: which part of your life is loudest right now?</h3><p>Pick one. You'll land on that part of the year, with a free lesson from it.</p><div class="opts"><a class="brown" href="/preview-as-learned/"><b>The past</b>I keep repeating a pattern and I want to see where it came from.</a><a class="green" href="/preview-as-loved/"><b>The present</b>I know what to do. I need someone in the room when I don't.</a><a class="navy" href="/preview-as-lived/"><b>The future</b>It matters now what I leave, not just what I earn.</a></div></div>
          </div></section>

    <section class="sec gallery-sec"><div class="wrap gallery"><figure><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1478131143081-80f7f84ca84d?w=1000&q=72&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Friends around a campfire at dusk" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>Every age</figcaption></figure><figure><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1501555088652-021faa106b9b?w=1000&q=72&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Two hikers on a mountain trail" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>Every background</figcaption></figure><figure><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1476234251651-f353703a034d?w=1000&q=72&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="A family walking through a field at golden hour" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>Every household</figcaption></figure></div></section>

    <section class="sec dark vid-sec" id="russ"><video class="bgvid" autoplay muted loop playsinline><source src="https://assets.mixkit.co/videos/47818/47818-720.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video><div class="veil"></div><div class="wrap guide-grid">
      <img src="/russ-michaels.jpg" alt="Russ Michaels" width="340" height="425" loading="lazy" />
      <div><p class="eyebrow">Your coach</p><h2>Russ Michaels</h2><p class="lede">Most coaches sell energy, a system, or a rule. Russ is a practicing attorney and a twenty-year operator who coaches from the whole picture: how you were built, how you are living, and what you intend to leave. He does the same daily lesson you do, on the same calendar, in public.</p><blockquote>Sometimes we meet life where it is, not where we are. We hold that together.</blockquote><div class="ctarow"><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="https://www.vaulthuman.com/writing">Writing</a><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/russ-michaels/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LinkedIn</a></div></div>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec alt" id="how"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">How it works</p><h2>Three steps.</h2><p class="lede">One lesson a day, one room at a time, with a person who reads what you write. <a href="/method/">Read how the method works.</a></p></div>
      <div class="steps"><div class="step"><div class="n">01</div><h3>Sign up</h3><p>$97 a month. A real person replies within the minute, with your first lesson.</p></div><div class="step"><div class="n">02</div><h3>Talk to Russ</h3><p>A 30-minute call within two days. No sales pitch.</p></div><div class="step"><div class="n">03</div><h3>Walk the year</h3><p>One lesson a day. Write three lines at night. We read them.</p></div></div>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec" id="pricing"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">Pricing</p><h2>A year, not a weekend.</h2></div>
      <div class="offers"><div class="offer feat"><div class="tag">Start here</div><h3>The Keys</h3><div class="price">$97<small>/mo</small></div><p>Seven days free first. Then one short lesson every morning, a real person reading your notes, and a group call each month.</p><a class="btn btn-acc" href="#" data-open-form>Start free</a><p class="guarantee" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,.7)">14 days free, cancel any time. $970 a year if you'd rather.</p></div><div class="offer"><span class="seats">12 seats · starts January 2027</span><div class="tag">With a coach</div><h3>The Coached Year</h3><div class="price">$1,250<small>/mo</small></div><p>Everything above, plus a private session with Russ every week and a small group of six. Twelve months.</p><a class="btn btn-acc" href="#" data-open-form>Apply</a></div><div class="offer"><div class="tag">For families</div><h3>The Family Year</h3><div class="price">$2,500<small>/mo</small></div><p>The Coached Year for your household, two to four people, together.</p><a class="btn btn-acc" href="#" data-open-form>Ask</a></div></div>
      <p class="offers-note">All three are Vault Human programs, coached by Russ. Buying for a company? Executive, leadership and team coaching is sold to organizations by <a href="https://triplicityadvisory.com">Triplicity</a>. You are never charged for the past, the present or the future. You pay for coaching.</p>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec dark" id="parts"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">Learn · Love · Live</p><h2>Your life, in three parts.</h2><p class="lede">Which part is loudest right now? Pick one. We'll send your first lesson from there.</p></div>
      <div class="tl-rail"></div>
      <div class="tl-cards"><a class="tlc brown" href="/preview-as-learned/"><div class="when">The past · Learn</div><h3>As Learned</h3><p>How you were wired. What you were taught. What still runs you.</p><span>Life as learned →</span></a><a class="tlc green" href="/preview-as-loved/"><div class="when">The present · Love</div><h3>As Loved</h3><p>The life you're actually in. Being mindful is the work.</p><span>Life as loved →</span></a><a class="tlc navy" href="/preview-as-lived/"><div class="when">The future · Live</div><h3>As Lived</h3><p>What you'll leave behind. Purpose, legacy, the plan.</p><span>Life as lived →</span></a></div>
      <p class="constant">One coach. One method. <a href="/#pricing">One price to start.</a></p>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec alt" id="faq"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">Questions</p><h2>Straight answers.</h2></div>
      <div class="faq"><details><summary>What is Vault Human, in one sentence?</summary><p>Daily coaching: a short lesson every morning, one small action, and a real person who reads what you write.</p></details><details><summary>What are Fretwork, Triplicity and Tercet?</summary><p>Three companies under the same owner that serve organizations, not members: Fretwork automates business systems, Triplicity sells executive and leadership coaching to companies, Tercet Law does wills, trusts and succession. A Vault Human member never needs any of them.</p></details><details><summary>Is Russ really the coach?</summary><p>Yes. A practicing attorney, a twenty-year operator and board president, who does the same daily lesson you do. In 2027 he coaches eighteen people. Trainers he certifies begin coaching in 2028.</p></details><details><summary>Is this therapy?</summary><p>No. It is coaching. If you need a therapist, we say so.</p></details><details><summary>How much time does it take?</summary><p>About ten minutes a day. The Coached Year adds an hour a week.</p></details><details><summary>Can I cancel?</summary><p>Yes. Any time, no fee.</p></details></div>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec final vid-sec" id="begin"><video class="bgvid" autoplay muted loop playsinline><source src="https://assets.mixkit.co/videos/22728/22728-720.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video><div class="veil"></div><div class="wrap">
      <h2>Start tomorrow morning.</h2><p class="lede">Sign up tonight. Your first free lesson is in your inbox at 7 a.m.</p>
      <div class="ctarow"><a class="btn btn-acc" href="#" data-open-form>Start free — 7 days</a><a class="btn btn-line" href="tel:+18888332510">(888) 833-2510</a></div>
    </div></section>
  </main>

